Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 10:41:46 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 27/29] refactor(vfs/io): extract writeback pending-upload
 accounting
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Partial #12 (gqf2008/brewfs)

Ninth slice: move RecentPendingUploadState, InflightBytesGuard and the
accounting methods (~496 lines) into src/vfs/io/writer_accounting.rs;
SliceFreezeReason / AutoFreezeTrigger become pub(crate) for the sibling
module. Pure code motion — no behavior change; writer tests (70) pass.
writer.rs 9258 -> 8761 lines.
---
